Subject: [PATCH] Add Malbolge language and grammar

- Register DannyBaanks/malbolge-syntax grammar submodule via script/add-grammar
- Add Malbolge to grammars.yml (source.malbolge)
- Add Malbolge entry to lib/linguist/languages.yml
- Add samples/Malbolge/truth_machine.malbolge sample
- Regenerate vendor/README.md via script/list-grammars
